# Proof of Valor (Q271): an orc fighter of level 4 accepts at Rukain (a guard); Kasha wolves give
# two fangs each (the one-in-four roll pinned to two), the fiftieth fang moving the quest on; Rukain
# takes them for a necklace, here pinned to the necklace of valor, and the repeatable quest ends.
# Holding the necklace, Rukain offers the quest with his "already proven" page, and accepting it
# again answers that page too; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q271_proof_of_valor.golden
character Valiant 4
class 44
random always 0
script quest.Q271_ProofOfValor
item 1473 1507 1506
page guard/30577.htm
page script/quest/Q271_ProofOfValor/
npc rukain 30577 Guard 10 0 0
npc wolf 20475 Monster 40 0 0

# Rukain: accept.
action rukain
action rukain
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=rukain item=0 page=guard/30577.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{rukain}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=rukain item=0 page=script/quest/Q271_ProofOfValor/30577-02.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  state Q271_ProofOfValor CREATED
bypass Quest Q271_ProofOfValor 30577-03.htm
  S QuestList 271:0x80000001
  S ExShowQuestMark quest=271
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_accept bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=rukain item=0 page=script/quest/Q271_ProofOfValor/30577-03.htm
  S ActionFailed
  Q upsert Q271_ProofOfValor | <state> | STARTED
  Q upsert Q271_ProofOfValor | <cond> | 1
  state Q271_ProofOfValor STARTED
  rows Q271_ProofOfValor <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
action rukain
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=rukain item=0 page=guard/30577.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{rukain}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=rukain item=0 page=script/quest/Q271_ProofOfValor/30577-04.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed

